  "criteria": [
    {"id": "AC1", "text": "With a Codex profile that keeps only basic shell variables (`inherit = \"core\"`), the Codex start of the coordinator sets `PDD_AUTOPILOT_CONTEXT` for the commands of the chat to the same start context that the coordinator process gets."},
    {"id": "AC2", "text": "The Codex start sets `HERDR_PANE_ID` and `HERDR_SOCKET_PATH` for the commands of the chat only when the launcher knows both exact values, and it never invents them. The launcher does not know the socket path of the coordinator pane, so the start sets neither, even when the pane has both."},
    {"id": "AC3", "text": "The Codex start keeps its folder-trust and update-check settings, and Autopilot writes no Codex configuration."}
  ],
